        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 2115/2109, Double Cylinder Lexington Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFeaturing a 5-pin cylinder and a 1 inch throw bolt with two hardened steel rollers that prevent sawing, the Lexington Double Cylinder Entry Handleset is not only functional, it is beautiful. The oval mounts of this Weslock made double cylinder entry set paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. The Lexington Handleset comes with your choice of inside trim--either a knob or a lever. A double cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by a key from both the exterior and the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior. Double cylinder entry sets are most often used on doors located near windows. Easy to install, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches. It will adjust to fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. An ANSI rated grade 2 lock, this outside trim handleset made by Weslock not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is key operated from both the interior and the exterior while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob/lever from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-single-cylinder-lexington-handleset-weslock-2115-2100\"><b>Lexington Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-lexington-dummy-handleset-weslock-2105-2104\"><b>Lexington Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/lexington-dual-keyed-double-cylinder-handleset-weslock-1343-1302\"><b>Lexington Dual Keyed Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties..\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Lexington Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latches with removable faceplates.</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" minimum center to center cross hole spacing</li>\r\n<li>1 inch throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers to prevent sawing.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Oval Lexington Double Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for  2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Lexington Double Cylinder Handleset, Weslock 2115/2109",
                "description": "Oval Lexington Double Cylinder Handleset - Featuring a 5-pin cylinder and a 1 inch throw bolt with two hardened steel rollers that prevent sawing, the Lexington Double Cylinder Entry Handleset is not only functional, it is beautiful. A double cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by a key from both the exterior and the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior. Double cylinder entry sets are most often used on doors located near windows. Easy to install, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches. It will adjust to fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. ",
